<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;">-</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> Reasoning-heavy phases → deep-reasoner (Opus 4.8)</span></span>
